{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KALkigRmdqJQsuAFjxbp39","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 9\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-18 07:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP Direct variant 340M 全模型 random-chance → 先跑 log-prob 评估，同时查 1.3B 模型可用性\\\\n  rationale: 16 个模型（含 Transformer baseline）在 depth 1-5 上全部 ~10% accuracy。根因：340M 模型无法通过\\\\n    generation 完成 in-context function lookup（输出\\\\\\\"1998/1999\\\\\\\"而非执行查找）。Transformer ceiling\\\\n    0% → ROADMAP 的 ceiling≥50% 过滤器触发，无 eligible depth。核心理论未被证伪，只是 340M+generation\\\\n    这个探针失效。下一步：(1) log-prob 评估（30min，测 internal representation 差异），(2) 并行查 1.3B 模型可用性。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-18 09:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: 1.3B 也无 function composition ICL 能力，MVP 从 synthetic task 双轨 pivot：7B task\\\\n    validation + 1.3B standard benchmarks\\\\n  rationale: 两轮实验（340M generation+logprob, 1.3B generation+logprob）一致确认 Ye et al.\\\\n    的 L-FuncComp 对 Wang et al. base models 不可行——Transformer baseline 自身也只有 random-chance，无法建立\\\\n    ceiling。根因：pretrained base models 在 ≤1.3B 规模未习得 arbitrary lookup table 的 ICL 能力。核心理论未被证伪，但\\\\n    synthetic task 作为 probe 在此 scale 下失效。Pivot 方案：(1) 7B Instruct 快速验证 task design\\\\n    是否本身有问题，(2) 在已有 1.3B hybrid 模型上跑 standard benchmarks（LAMBADA/HellaSwag/ARC/MMLU）检测架构差异信号——如果\\\\n    attention ratio 对不同难度 benchmark 的影响不同，MVP 仍可 pass，且论文更有 practical relevance。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-18 09:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: 预注册 benchmark composition depth 赋值（结果出来前锁定，不可事后调整）\\\\n  rationale: 'IDEA_BRIEF 要求 \\\\\\\"composition depth must be derivable from task structure\\\\n    alone, not from empirical performance\\\\\\\"。在 Track 1 benchmark 结果出来前锁定每个 task 的 depth\\\\n    赋值，防止 post-hoc rationalization。赋值基于 task 的计算结构分析：depth 1 = 单步模式匹配/句法判断（无需跨 context\\\\n    组合信息）；depth 2 = 需要检索 + 单步推理组合；depth 3 = 需要多步推理链或跨多个 context 片段组合。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    预注册赋值：\\\\n\\\\n    - Depth 1: lambada_openai (last-word prediction, 单步 pattern completion), blimp\\\\n    (单条句法规则判断)\\\\n\\\\n    - Depth 2: hellaswag (situation model + completion matching), winogrande (coreference:\\\\n    world knowledge + reasoning), arc_easy (单步 science reasoning), mmlu 5-shot (knowledge\\\\n    retrieval + single-step reasoning)\\\\n\\\\n    - Depth 3: arc_challenge (multi-step science reasoning, 需要推理链)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    需补充 depth 3+ 任务使 Spearman 相关性有足够 depth 分层。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-18 16:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: GDN hybrid-3-1 存在 attn.num_heads confound（16 vs 32），论文分析需区分 GDN（有 confound）和\\\\n    RetNet/HGRN2（无 confound）\\\\n  rationale: Wang et al. 的 GDN hybrid-3-1 在 340M 和 1.3B 规模都使用 attn.num_heads=16（GQA\\\\n    2:1），而 h6/h12/h24 使用 32（GQA 4:1）。这意味着 h3-1 不仅 attention 层更多，per-layer attention\\\\n    capacity 也不同。RetNet 和 HGRN2 所有 ratio 统一 16 heads，无此问题。论文中 GDN 跨 ratio 趋势需标注此 caveat；如果\\\\n    RetNet/HGRN2 的 clean 数据显示一致趋势，可缓解 GDN confound 的影响。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 12:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 原始 entrainment 假设 FAIL，pivot to Equalizer Effect story，target EMNLP\\\\n    2026\\\\n  rationale: 26 模型 ×6 benchmarks 全面否定原假设。但发现 equalizer effect（attention 使不同架构在 LAMBADA\\\\n    上收敛）+ scale dependency（1.3B 完全 vs 340M 部分）+ per-example mechanism（不同架构不同 sample\\\\n    子集，Jaccard ~0.09）。用户设定 venue=EMNLP 2026，表明继续推进。Pivot 方向：empirical analysis paper，围绕\\\\n    equalizer effect 的 quantitative characterization + scale dependency + mechanistic\\\\n    analysis。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_340m_retnet_hgrn2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 340M partial convergence confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: hgrn2_eval_h3_1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: architecture-dependent direction confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 13:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream best case 2.5/5 → 重大 framing 调整：放弃 \\\\\\\"paradox\\\\\\\" 叙事，转为 \\\\\\\"quantification\\\\n    of known phenomenon in hybrid architectures\\\\\\\"；补 high-retrieval benchmarks；补 Related\\\\n    Work\\\\n  rationale: Dream 模拟审稿（best case）暴露四个 Major weakness：(1) 单 benchmark 统计显著性——Bonferroni\\\\n    下 LAMBADA p=0.017 不通过；(2) \\\\\\\"equalizer paradox\\\\\\\" 是已知现象（ensemble diversity, underspecification）——我们不能声称发现\\\\n    paradox；(3) mechanistic claims 是 correlational 不是 causal；(4) 纯 re-analysis Wang\\\\n    et al. 模型的 incremental contribution。Path to Findings (3.0) 需要：Related Work 20+\\\\n    refs、去掉 paradox framing、额外 high-retrieval benchmark（第二个显著 anchor）。Path to Main\\\\n    (4.0) 需要 interventional experiments + 7B，不可行。调整策略目标：EMNLP Findings (3.0)。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: only LAMBADA significant, W1 confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-003\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: surface features negative, W3 weakens mechanism claims\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 14:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: MMLU blacklisted from convergence evidence — GDN-excluded sensitivity reveals\\\\n    ρ flips to +0.6\\\\n  rationale: exp-008 GDN-excluded sensitivity analysis shows MMLU ρ flips from -0.7\\\\n    to +0.6 when GDN (carrying D004 confound) is removed. The apparent MMLU convergence\\\\n    was entirely driven by GDN. Any reviewer running GDN-excluded robustness check\\\\n    would catch this immediately. MMLU must NOT appear as convergence support in the\\\\n    paper. ARC-Easy improves from -0.7 to -0.9 (p=0.083) after GDN exclusion — signal\\\\n    is cleaner, usable as suggestive evidence especially alongside exp-011.\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: MMLU convergence entirely GDN-driven; ARC-Easy signal improves post-exclusion\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-19 15:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-010 \\\\\\\"co-evolution\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"decoupling\\\\\\\" framing：per-example divergence 在\\\\n    4% attention 即饱和，aggregate convergence 逐步递减，二者解耦\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 5-point Spearman ρ=-0.70 (p=0.23) 被 pure=0 退化点膨胀（Jaccard=NaN→0）。去掉后\\\\n    4-point ρ=-0.40, p=0.75。实际 pattern 是 Jaccard 在首个 attention level 即饱和 (~0.095)，aggregate\\\\n    σ 逐步下降。\\\\\\\"Decoupling\\\\\\\" 是比 \\\\\\\"co-evolution\\\\\\\" 更准确且更强的叙事——aggregate 趋同掩盖了 increasingly\\\\n    divergent per-example dynamics。Net asymmetry 递增 (0.013→0.040) 进一步支持此解读。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-010\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: Aggregate σ monotonically decreasing; Jaccard flat ~0.095; net asymmetry\\\\n      increasing\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 5998, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WvDiGxxVB9bvo8KQe4fsPd","session_id":"d5f8c2b8-a1ca-4a4a-8211-80150d29dabf","uuid":"251e09c0-e2c0-406d-928d-a6a8793234bb","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:32:22.813Z"}
